==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Using the [[Crazy Hearts (Combo)|Crazy Hearts]] [[Cat Combo|Combo]] along with any [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] can quickly complete this level. Otherwise, [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] is enough to take this level on his own.

